formvis is a layered image editor: layers, folders, masks, clipping, blend
modes, selections, painting, filters, colour management, and PSD, TIFF, EXR
and OpenRaster files.

This port installs the engine (a local web service in Python) with the built
web page. Run "formvis", then open http://127.0.0.1:8190/ in a browser. Edits
stay on this computer.
